<title>USA: Enamelon granted patent for chewing gum.</title>
<headline>Enamelon granted patent for chewing gum.</headline>
<dateline>YONKERS, N.Y. 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Enamelon Inc said on Tuesday the United States Patent and Trademark Office granted it a patent for calcium and phosphate compounds which could be formulated in sugarless chewing gum.</p>
<p>Steven Fox, Chairman of Enamelon, said, &quot;we intend to commercialize any future chewing gum products through a joint venture with a major chewing gum manufacturer.&quot;</p>
<p>Enamelon develops and markets over-the-counter oral care products based on proprietary formulations and technologies.</p>
</text>
